\par N\u7907\'3f TK 78 "Thanh to\'e1n trong n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f ng\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f v\'e3ng lai".
\par C\'f3 TK 51 "Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0ng" (TK 51.1).
\par K\u7871\'3f to\'e1n c\u7911\'3fa c\u7917\'3fa h\'e0ng nh\u7853\'3f}{\f267\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 n \'f0\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \u7907\'3fc ti\u7873\'3fn Vi\u7879\'3ft Nam do C\'f4ng ty chuy\u7875\'3fn xu
