\par N\u7907\'3f TK 51 "Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0ng"
\par C\'f3 TK 78 "Thanh to\'e1n trong n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f ng\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c nghi\u7879\'3fp v\u7909\'3f v\'e3ng lai".
\par 5- B\'e1o c\'e1o  k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn vay v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f:
\par }{\f259\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \'d0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \u7875\'3f ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh t\'ecnh h\'ecnh vay v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f, tr\'ean b\u7843\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng k
\u7871\'3ft t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7911\'3f}{\f267\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 a c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \u7883\'3f s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh,  c\'e1c t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc ngo
\u7841\'3f}{\f267\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 i th\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \u7907\'3fc vay ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f c\u7911\'3fa qu\u7929\'3f ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3f
u c\u7847\'3fn b\u7893\'3f sung th\'eam c\'e1c ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f:
\par - Vay ng\u7855\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f (94.2) sau m\u7909\'3fc II. Vay c\u7843\'3fi ti\u7871\'3fn k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft m\u7903\'3f r\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft (94) thu\u7897\'3fc lo\u7841\'3fi  C t\'e0
i s\u7843\'3fn n\u7907\'3f.
\par - N go\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0ng ch\u7901\'3f ph\'e2n t\'edch k\u7871\'3ft h\u7889\'3fi (51.2)
\par - Ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f g\u7917\'3fi ng\'e2n h\'e0ng (51.3).
\par - V\u7889\'3fn b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn kh\'e1c b\u7857\'3fng ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc lo\u7841\'3fi C t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\'f3.
\par - Ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f}{\f267\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341  \'f0\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9514326\charrsid8065341 \u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng (011) ph\u7843\'3fn \'e1nh ngo\'e0i b\u7843\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng k
\u7871\'3ft t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn.
